&#xD;
![devContainer_7.png](https://image.toast.com/aaaadh/real/2025/techblog/devContainer7.png)&#xD;
④ 컨테이너 빌드 완료 및 방화벽 정상작동 확인 후 터미널에서 `claude --dangerously-skip-permissions` 실행&#xD;
&#xD;
![devContainer_8.png](https://image.toast.com/aaaadh/real/2025/techblog/devContainer8.png)&#xD;
&#xD;
⑤ 필요시 Gemini CLI도 확인&#xD;
![devContainer_9.png](https://image.toast.com/aaaadh/real/2025/techblog/devContainer9.png)&#xD;
&#xD;
⑥ 다시 로컬로 돌아가려면 **Reopen Folder Locally** 버튼 클릭&#xD;
