[![NHN Cloud_meetup banner_Jailbreak_202507-01-01.png](https://image.toast.com/aaaadh/real/2025/techblog/NHN%20Cloudmeetup%20bannerJailbreak2025070101.png)](https://www.nhncloud.com/kr)&#xD;
